values ('marketing', 'SEO', 'seo', 'Rank where your customers are already searching.', 'SEO Services That Win Customers Who Are Already Searching', 'Rank where your customers are already searching. We fix the technical foundations, sharpen your pages and publish content that answers real buyer questions — then measure SEO by leads and sales, not just rankings.', 'search', array['Technical SEO audit and fixes (speed, indexing, crawl errors)', 'Keyword and search intent research', 'On-page optimization of key service and product pages', 'Structured data (schema) implementation', 'Internal linking and site architecture', 'Content plan and SEO-led content', 'Google Search Console and analytics setup', 'Monthly report with outcomes and next actions']::text[],
